      "text": "serpent raised in wilderness a type of Christ, 1 Ne. 17:41 (2 Ne. 25:20; Alma 33:19–21; Hel. 8:14–15; Num. 21:8–9). all things given of God from beginning typify Christ, 2 Ne. 11:4. the Lord showed his people many types of his coming, Mosiah 3:15. Abinadi’s death a type of things to come, Mosiah 13:10 (Alma 25:10). law of Moses a type of Christ’s coming, Mosiah 13:30–31 (16:14; Alma 25:15; 34:14; Gal. 3:24; Heb. 10:1). ordinances given as a type of the Son’s order, Alma 13:16. working of Liahona a type of word of Christ, Alma 37:38–46. there has been a type for building of New Jerusalem, Ether 13:6.",
